    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "roles_body",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 238,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "super-admin  every org; creates orgs + users;\n             seeded as the founder account\norg-admin    own org: branding, settings, users,\n             Registo, automation, app build/edit\nuser         member: chat + own/org-shared\n             artifacts; NOT app build/edit (H1)",
